{
  "_doc": "TIMING run for SDTA (E1 W=1). 6-epoch pretrain+train on a channel ladder, seed 97, num_workers=1, serial (concurrent=1, GPU0). Drop epoch1, mean epochs 2..6 of elapsed_sec per stage. [W=1 variant, created 2026-07-25 to complete the E×D×W grid on RTX 4090]",
